WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
Attention all survivors

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,200
The country will not give up on anyone

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,800
Every three months starting from today

4
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:07,080
We will carry out nationwide airdrop missions of supplies

5
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:10,160
The airdrop supply box is equipped with basic survival equipment and emergency medicines

6
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:12,040
Ensure that people without professional knowledge can operate it

7
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:13,520
and detailed instructions for use

8
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:14,440
Please rest assured

9
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:16,280
Supplies boxes use biometric identification

10
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:17,240
Only humans can open it

11
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:19,560
Non-human creatures will trigger the process of supporting themselves

12
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:20,680
Solemnly declare again

13
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:21,640
please keep hope

14
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:23,200
Pay attention to signs in the sky

15
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:24,880
Please do your best to live

16
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:29,170
The country is still there

17
00:00:29,170 --> 00:00:34,390
Heading date: November 14th

18
00:00:34,510 --> 00:00:35,830
Start from the spirit

19
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:37,910
Deliver sequentially according to predetermined grid

20
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:39,230
No. 14

21
00:00:39,230 --> 00:00:40,190
Two days left

22
00:00:40,190 --> 00:00:41,990
And it starts from the spirit

23
00:00:41,990 --> 00:00:43,430
Drone swarms are fast

24
00:00:43,430 --> 00:00:44,630
If the delivery goes smoothly

25
00:00:44,630 --> 00:00:45,750
It won't be long before it's possible

26
00:00:45,750 --> 00:00:50,260
Cover our area

27
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:52,060
Will madmen evolve?

28
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:54,500
I hid at home and relied on my savings for a month.

29
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:57,340
But I discovered something very scary a few days ago

30
00:00:57,340 --> 00:00:59,140
You are a bunch of lunatics who only know how to torture and kill.

31
00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:00,980
Behavior patterns seem to have changed

32
00:01:00,980 --> 00:01:03,100
Becoming a little regular
